The explicit native OCIO preparation recipe builds OpenColorIO 2.6.0
(BSD-3-Clause), Expat and yaml-cpp (MIT), pystring and Imath (BSD-3-Clause),
and zlib and minizip-ng (Zlib). Exact authors and source identities are in
ATTRIBUTION.md and tools/ocio_sources.json. Apple ARM additionally uses the
unmodified, pinned sse2neon header (MIT; Copyright (c) 2015-2024 SSE2NEON
Contributors). All seven original license texts (eight on Apple ARM)
are copied without modification into the generated prefix/licenses/ocio/
directory and included in its verified runtime manifest. Native distribution
is explicit and recorded per desktop archive; availability alone does not
establish complete application color management.
Unmodified copies in tools/tests/ocio_licenses/ are offline validation fixtures.

