The photographed screen regression uses a credited, resized NASA / ISS crew
image under NASA's informational media-use guidelines. See ATTRIBUTION.md and
the fixture-local source record. This technical evaluation does not imply NASA
endorsement; the image is not relicensed under the repository MIT license or
included in product release resources.

Photographed chroma-key API tests include three modified Blender Foundation /
Mango footage derivatives under CC BY 3.0. Fixture-local attribution and the
legal-code link are retained; see ATTRIBUTION.md for pinned identities and
conversion scope. The footage is not licensed under this repository MIT license.

External camera calibration acceptance records use OpenCV sample photographs
(Apache-2.0). They are not bundled into the product. The pinned upstream LICENSE
and COPYRIGHT are retained with validation data; see ATTRIBUTION.md for sources,
revision and the scope of derived measurements and replacement renders.

The optional plugin-author language client interoperates with separately installed,
unmodified wgsl-analyzer (wgsl-analyzer contributors, MIT OR Apache-2.0).
The server is not embedded in this repository, effect packages or release pipeline.
Source, tested revision and license links are recorded in ATTRIBUTION.md.

